extends layout/page

block body
  main
    h1 × Training & Workshops
    p The best way to learn software engineering is to build software. We don't do theoretical whiteboard sessions. With over a decade of experience building and scaling complex systems, we design deeply technical, hands-on masterclasses that permanently elevate how your team writes, tests, and ships code.

    hr

    h2 Core Masterclasses
    p Battle-tested modules we have successfully delivered to enterprise teams, startups, and universities.

    h3 ❯&#32;
      a(href="#todo") Domain-Driven Design
    .tag Duration: 3 Days
    .tag Capacity: 4–8 Engineers
    p We don't just teach theory; we teach how to untangle the knot. This workshop guides teams through breaking down failing monoliths safely, defining strict context boundaries, and understanding when microservices solve problems and when they just create distributed nightmares.

    h3 ❯&#32;
      a(href="#todo") Discovering the Native Web
    .tag Duration: 3 Days
    .tag Capacity: 4–8 Engineers
    p Stop rebuilding your frontend every three years. Learn how to design durable, framework-agnostic user interfaces using native Web Components, Shadow DOM, and lightweight rendering paradigms (like HTMX) to break free from the modern JS upgrade treadmill.

    h3 ❯&#32;
      a(href="#todo") Micro-Frontends
    .tag Duration: 1 Day
    .tag Capacity: 2-6 Engineers
    p Scale your frontend development across multiple autonomous teams without breaking the user experience. We cover integration patterns, shared state, web components, and deployment strategies to stop your frontend teams from stepping on each other's toes.

    h3 ❯&#32;
      a(href="#todo") Infrastructure Automation
    .tag Duration: 4 Days
    .tag Capacity: 4-9 Engineers
    p Take your team from fearful, manual Friday deployments to automated, zero-downtime continuous delivery. We cover Docker containerization, Ansible configuration management, pipeline architecture, and the cultural shift required to deploy with absolute confidence.

    h3 ❯&#32;
      a(href="#todo") SOLID Programming
    .tag Duration: 3 Days
    .tag Capacity: 4-6 Engineers
    p A hands-on rewiring of how your team approaches code. We embed with your engineers to practice Test-Driven Development (TDD), Pair Programming, clean architectures, and continuous refactoring. We prove that writing tests doesn't slow you down – it is the only way to go fast forever.

    hr

    h2 Forward-Looking Briefings (On-Demand)
    p Custom, high-impact briefings tailored for CTOs, technical founders, and senior engineering teams navigating paradigm shifts.

    h3 ❯&#32;
      a(href="#todo") Stop Building AI Wrappers
    .tag 1 Day Intensive
    p Move beyond fragile prototypes and basic prompt engineering. We teach your team how to secure and stabilize AI within your core systems. Learn how to architect strict tooling harnesses (MCP), implement semantic caching, and build defensive pipelines that prevent prompt-injection vulnerabilities and runaway API bills.

    h3 ❯&#32;
      a(href="#todo") Don't let AI Lock you in!
    .tag 1 Day Intensive
    p Why relying entirely on OpenAI or Anthropic is a margin-eating trap. We cover how to run, fine-tune, and deploy local open-weights LLMs securely on your own infrastructure to protect your proprietary data, minimize latency, and guarantee uptime.

    h3 ❯&#32;
      a(href="#todo") Applied Cryptography
    .tag 1 Day Intensive
    p Decentralization is more than just tokens. We brief your team on decentralized identity protocols (like Nostr), verifiable credentials, and how to safely implement cryptographic signing and decentralized storage (IPFS) into traditional Web2 infrastructures.

    hr
    h4 Ready to level up your engineering team?
    p Tell us where your team is struggling...
